	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg16887"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=522" title="View the profile of Self Destruction">Self Destruction</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Splitpaw Gnoll<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 96<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://img.photobucket.com/albums/v425/Undead13/Sharingan.gif" width="65" height="65" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								With Teeth<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=522"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16887#msg16887"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16887#msg16887">Re: And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #2911 on:</b> May 04, 2005, 03:38:46 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							&quot;Just because someone is retired does not mean they cant troll or post here.&quot;<br /><br />Very well. If trolling is a mod accepted behavior on this board, then that&#039;s super. Once we merge and if we do keep the Quellious name, perhaps the mods on the Quell boards won&#039;t share this view. Who knows..<br /><br />As far as IL and blocking on Coir...I still don&#039;t have a problem with IL or it&#039;s members. I think they&#039;re a great guild and one example of them doing something I don&#039;t really agree with won&#039;t change that.<br /><br />As far as retired people posting here...I think the retired people are being a bit defensive and aren&#039;t understanding what I&#039;m saying. There&#039;s nothing wrong at all with people who no longer play posting here. My complaint came specifically from people coming here just to be negative...of which there seems to be a few retired people umong them. If my previous posts were taken wrong and made you think that I was talking about all retired people, then I hope I have cleared that up.<br /><br />Also, I&#039;m not speaking as a representative of UoP in regards to anything about the recent discussions on this board. I&#039;m merely a member stating my own personal opinion.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" /><img src="http://img.photobucket.com/albums/v425/Undead13/Virsig1.png" alt="" border="0" /><br /><br /><a href="http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=859121" target="_blank"><font size="4">Fateseer Virulence</font></a><br /><b>the Plague 70 Prophet</b>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg16890"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=236" title="View the profile of Carsonn">Carsonn</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Hill Giant<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 127<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/demon1.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								I&#039;m a llama!<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=236"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16890#msg16890"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16890#msg16890">Re: And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #2912 on:</b> May 04, 2005, 04:24:22 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16878#msg16878">Quote from: Frofro on May 04, 2005, 02:08:49 pm</a></div><div class="quote"><div class="quoteheader"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16868#msg16868">Quote from: Carsonn on May 04, 2005, 12:34:02 pm</a></div><div class="quote">How does cockblocking change?  How does UoP cockblocking about a year ago maybe a 1 and half ago not the same to IL doing it today?  And you say don&#039;t label the guild but you are labeling IL for about 2 groups worth of people.  That wasn&#039;t there entire guild.  The really diffreance is UoP&#039;s guild leader was the brains behind that cockblocking along with Grimborn so please explain the diffrance.<br /></div><br />I&#039;m not saying cock blocking has changed! I&#039;m saying the majority People you are labeling and master cock blockers are not even in the Guild anymore. It was a long time ago, and yes Grimborn might  still be a officer but most of the officers at the time have retired or left, along with most of the members at the time. So when you say UoP, you are pointing your finger at me, Mizin and many others that i assure you had nothing to do with what you are claiming as the reason we deserved to be blocked.<br /></div><br />I&#039;m not saying you desevered to be blocked what I am saying is don&#039;t complain about it when UoP has had that rep.&nbsp; I wouldn&#039;t condone IL for there actions but it was a nice kill and they did what they had to do in there eyes.&nbsp; Your members come on here crying foul and act innocent.&nbsp; There is a 3 day spawn time between named I belive so your not going to be block more then 3 days or so but you will get him.&nbsp; Why cry about it if you know you will get a shoot in 3 days.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg16891"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=1008" title="View the profile of Stuman">Stuman</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 2<br />
								<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=1008"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16891#msg16891"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16891#msg16891">Re: And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #2913 on:</b> May 04, 2005, 04:58:33 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Why blow the spawn and risk the tainted guild rep like IL did when it will respawn in 3 days?&nbsp; &nbsp;<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/smiley1.gif" alt="Smiley" border="0" />
						</td>
					</tr>
