							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16892#msg16892"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16892#msg16892">Re: And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #2914 on:</b> May 04, 2005, 05:38:00 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							About the cockblocking?<br /><img src="http://www.explodingdog.com/dumbpict51/idontthinkicare.gif" alt="" width="600" border="0" /><br /><br />Good for IL! They took matters into their own hands. Yeah, I&#039;m in UoP. No, I don&#039;t care that IL blew the spawn before we could get set up so they could have Coirnav at their raid time. So what?! It&#039;s part of the game. Plus, IL said, on the record, that they don&#039;t want Coirnav again, so we&#039;re free to it whenever we want.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
