	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg16893"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=893" title="View the profile of Guzum">Guzum</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 16<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://g.myspace.com/00046/85/92/46922958_m.jpg" width="65" height="65" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								pimpin&#039; elves since &#039;99<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=893"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:munkee@hotmail.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16893#msg16893"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16893#msg16893">Re: And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #2915 on:</b> May 04, 2005, 05:45:06 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Well they moreso just, put off the spawn till IL&#039;s raid schedule, hard to hit targets that EST/CST guilds will try and pop before you even start raiding. So big deal, a few people went in and killed the trigger to give IL a chance at takin him out at their raid time. It&#039;s first come first serve, if you don&#039;t like it then you may be playing on the wrong server or even the wrong game&nbsp; <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/bonk.gif" alt="Bonk" border="0" />. <br /><br />Sure some actions may seem shady but if it benefits the people that the said group took action for then who cares. I doubt something as simple as what took place Sunday is going to taint IL&#039;s reputation. If others think it is then they need to grow some skin and suck it up, life&#039;s a bitch sometimes and things don&#039;t always work in your favor. Remember it&#039;s just a game, the goal is to advance and succeed by doing whatever it takes, sure it&#039;s also a social community where you may strive for people to like you or hate you. But who cares what actions you take in the game, as long as your not pissing off the people you want to keep happy, ie : friends, family, guildies.&nbsp; <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/saint.gif" alt="Saint" border="0" />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
